{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30597","headline":"和主司王起 · 林滋","name":"和主司王起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙门一变荷生成，况是三传不朽名。\n美誉早闻喧北阙，颓波今见走东瀛。\n鸳行既接参差影，鸡树仍同次第荣。\n从此青衿与朱紫，升堂侍宴更何营。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林滋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30597.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30597","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}